{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國男星羅拔柏迪臣（Robert Pattinson）日前以大熱姿態當選新一任占士邦，而近日有傳電影公司為了吸引羅拔去試鏡竟然出100萬美元（約780萬港元）作為試鏡「酬金」。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;據知就算羅拔試鏡失敗</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.444220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:50:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.329455+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.329455+00:00","content_hash":"070c9cc3ce6836ddea90470abe92538b0af612d367048b3d01edb4f7d00c94ed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}